{"surface":"நெடுநகர்","parts":[{"text":"நெடு","lemma":"நெடு","gloss":"tall"},{"text":"நகர்","lemma":"நகர்","gloss":"house"}],"gloss":"large house"},{"surface":"இயம்பும்","parts":[{"text":"இயம்பும்","lemma":"இயம்பு","gloss":"sounding"}],"gloss":"sounding"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெரும்","parts":[{"text":"பெரும்","lemma":"பெருமை","gloss":"great"}],"gloss":"great"},{"surface":"புலர்","parts":[{"text":"புலர்","lemma":"புலர்","gloss":"dawning"}],"gloss":"dawning"},{"surface":"விடியலும்","parts":[{"text":"விடியல்","lemma":"விடியல்","gloss":"dawn"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and the dawn"},{"surface":"மாலை","parts":[{"text":"மாலை","lemma":"மாலை","gloss":"evening"}],"gloss":"evening"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பகலும்","parts":[{"text":"பகல்","lemma":"பகல்","gloss":"daytime"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and the daytime"},{"surface":"மாலை","parts":[{"text":"மாலை","lemma":"மாலை","gloss":"evening"}],"gloss":"evening"},{"surface":"துணை","parts":[{"text":"துணை","lemma":"துணை","gloss":"companion"}],"gloss":"companion"},{"surface":"இலோர்க்கே","parts":[{"text":"இலோர்க்கே","lemma":"இலர்","gloss":"to those who do not have indeed"}],"gloss":"to those who do not have indeed"}]}],"literal":"Glow-going sky becoming-red, affliction having-intensified, / light-ceasing time, jasmine blooming / evening, they say, those who are confused indeed. / Crested rooster in-the-large-house sounding / great-dawning dawn also is evening, / daytime also is evening, to those who do not have a companion indeed.","translation":"Those who say evening is only when the glowing sun sets, the sky turns red, grief intensifies, and the jasmine blooms as light fades, are surely confused. For those who are without their companion, even the early dawn when the crested rooster crows in the large house is evening, and the bright daytime is evening too.","modern":"ஒளிரும் சூரியன் மறையும் வானம் சிவக்க, துன்பம் மிகுந்து, பகல் வெளிச்சம் அழியும் பொழுதில் முல்லை மலரும் மாலைப் பொழுதுதான் மாலைக் காலம் என்று கூறுபவர்கள் அறியாமையால் மயங்கியவர்கள் ஆவர். தங்களுக்குரிய துணை இல்லாதவர்களுக்கு, கொண்டையையுடைய சேவல் பெரிய வீட்டில் கூவுகின்ற விடியற்காலமும் மாலைப் பொழுதுதான்; பகல் பொழுதும் மாலைப் பொழுதுதான்.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her companion, expressing her deep grief during separation from her lover in the mullai (pastoral) landscape. She challenges the conventional definition of evening, which people associate only with the setting sun and blooming jasmines. For her, the pain of separation is so relentless that every part of the day feels like the agonizing evening. Even the early dawn, marked by the crested rooster crowing in the large house, and the bright daytime feel like evening to those who are lonely. The images of the rooster and the empty house emphasize her solitude and the endless nature of her longing.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.06],[1.06,1.53],[1.64,1.87],[2.09,2.84],[2.84,3.6],[3.6,3.8],[3.8,4.0],[4.0,4.7],[4.7,5.0],[5.0,5.5],[5.5,5.7],[5.7,6.36],[6.36,6.69],[6.69,7.35],[7.35,8.3],[8.3,8.83],[8.83,9.19],[9.2,9.9],[9.9,11.0],[11.0,11.3],[11.3,11.64],[11.64,12.1]],"female":[[0.0,0.81],[0.81,1.1],[1.4,1.7],[1.7,2.3],[2.3,3.2],[3.2,4.1],[4.1,4.3],[4.3,4.5],[4.5,5.7],[5.7,6.0],[6.0,6.7],[6.7,7.0],[7.0,7.56],[7.56,7.83],[7.83,8.39],[8.39,9.5],[9.5,10.15],[10.15,10.59],[10.6,11.3],[11.3,12.3],[12.3,12.7],[12.7,13.09],[13.09,13.6]]},"sync":[[["சுடர்","glow"],["செல்","going"]],[["வானம்","sky"]],[["சேப்ப","to become red"]],[["படர்","affliction"],["கூர்ந்","having intensified"]],[["தெல்","light"],["அறு","ceasing"]],[["பொழுதின்","at the time"]],[["முல்லை","jasmine"]],[["மலரும்","blooming"]],[["மாலை","evening"]],[["என்மனார்","they say"]],[["மயங்கி","having been confused"]],[["ஓரே","those indeed"]],[["குடுமி","crested"]],[["கோழி","rooster"]],[["நெடுநகர்","large house"]],[["நெடுநகர்","large house"],["இயம்பும்","sounding"]],[["பெரும்","great"],["புலர்","dawning"]],[["விடியலும்","and the dawn"]],[["விடியலும்","and the dawn"],["மாலை","evening"]],[["பகலும்","and the daytime"]],[["மாலை","evening"]],[["துணை","companion"]],[["இலோர்க்கே","to those who do not have indeed"]]]}